OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy over
OL,6,Fduring the evening with a few showers
OL,7,Fin the west, perhaps some clear spells
OL,8,Ftowards the Angus coast, heavier rain
OL,9,Fpossible by dawn.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,12,Fbest of any bright weather for Angus
OL,13,Fin the morning, a few heavier showers
OL,14,Fin the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA few
OL,17,Fshowers on Monday. Rain spreading east
OL,18,Fon Tuesday morning followed by
OL,19,Fshowers. Rain spreading northeast on
OL,20,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
